attr experiment Step4A
attr inifile omnetpp.ini
attr iterationvars ""
attr iterationvarsd ""
attr iterationvarsf ""
attr measurement ""
attr network RipNetworkA
attr processid 7130
attr repetition 0
attr replication #0
attr resultdir results
